:"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_05_s_88","text":"hereby officially declare that you, Leo, have fulfilled your contract with the foundation to the fullest extent.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_05_s_89","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_05_s_89","text":"I will now read this letter out loud on the signatory's behalf,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_05_s_90","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_05_s_90","text":"and bring this contract to its close.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_05_s_91","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_05_s_91","text":"*Rustle*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_05_s_92","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_05_s_92","text":"Snow Crane gingerly unfolds the letter.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_05_s_93","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_05_s_93","text":"\"To my beloved child, Leo.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_05_s_94","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_05_s_94","text":"\"After writing you once when you first joined the foundation, and again when you came of age and left the care facility,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_05_s_95","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_05_s_95","text":"I'm now writing you a third time.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_05_s_96","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_05_s_96","text":"\"Have you been well?\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_05_s_97","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_05_s_97","text":"\"If you're reading this letter,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_05_s_98","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_05_s_98","text":"it must mean you have kept your promise to the foundation for all these years.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_05_s_99","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_05_s_99","text":"\"I applaud such a remarkable display of devotion.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_05_s_100","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_05_s_100","text":"\"Despite the severe hardships you've endured from losing your family and being cast into an unfamiliar environment,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_05_s_101","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_05_s_101","text":"you've managed to live honestly without losing your light. That takes great courage and resolve, and I commend you for it.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_05_s_102","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_05_s_102","text":"\"While I am sorry that I cannot tell you all of this in person,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_05_s_103","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_05_s_103","text":"it also means that, like all of you, I too am keeping the promise I have made with someone.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_05_s_104","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_05_s_104","text":"\"Please understand that. I hope you'll forgive me.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_05_s_105","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_05_s_105","text":"\"I wish I could see for myself how all your faces have changed as you've grown up.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_05_s_106","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_05_s_106","text":"\"I bet you've become a fine adult.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_05_s_107","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_05_s_107","text":"\"In fact, I'm sure you have.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_05_s_108","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_05_s_108","text":"\"Though the contract will end, and the foundation will no longer walk through life beside you,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_05_s_109","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_05_s_109","text":"I truly believe you'll have already found new, dear family members.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_05_s_110","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_05_s_110","text":"\"So, Leo,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_05_s_111","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_05_s_111","text":"I do not know how much of life still lies before you,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_05_s_112","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_05_s_112","text":"but you've proved your devotion in your life up until now,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_05_s_113","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_05_s_113","text":"and for that, I hope that your life will continue to shine until the very end.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_05_s_114","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_05_s_114","text":"\"Even from afar, I will always be cheering for you.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_05_s_115","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_05_s_115","text":"\"Your eternal supporter in life.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_05_s_116","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_05_s_116","text":"Snow Crane folds the letter and places it in front of the smiling photo of Leo.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_05_s_117","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_05_s_117","text":"With this, I can report that all the foundation's contracts have come to an end.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_05_s_118","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_05_s_118","text":"... Leo.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goodworld_05_s_119","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowcrane","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_goodworld_05_s_119","text":"Thank you for al